2. What are the main features of python language?
A: 1) Python is a high level programming language.
2) Machine-independent
3) User-friendly syntax
We use indentation for different sections
4) General-purpose
It is used for many purposes like AI, machine learning, web applications, data science, software testing, game
development and networking field
5) Interpreted
It uses line by line execution. The interpreter converts high level language to byte code.
6) Portable
It can be used in any operating system like Windows, Linux, Ubuntu, Mac.
7) Dynamic type
We don't have to declare the data type of the variable explicitly. During the runtime, with the help of the interpreter
it detects the data type of the variable according to the value assigned to the variable.
8) Multi-programming paradigm-supporting
It supports both function oriented programming and object oriented programming.
9) Open source
It is free of cost.
10) Large community supported
11) It has a large library support

